                  {
                    "value": "Companies, rounds and investors: Greek Deep Tech Market Map dataset (github.com/geve-ops/greek-deeptech-market-map). Every row carries its own source links, shown on the Company detail page.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Signals: deal-flow tracker snapshot of 26 Oct 2026 (github.com/geve-ops/vc-dealflow-tracker): Google News, job boards, GitHub and CORDIS (EU-funded projects).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "FX: ECB euro reference rates of 12 Nov 2026 (USD 1.1081, GBP 0.83595 per EUR), ecb.europa.eu/stats/eurofxref. The sliders let you test other rates.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Modelling rules",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0B3C5D"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Amounts: the first figure stated in the amount text, in its own currency. '~' is flagged Approximate, 'more than' Lower bound. Texts that say not found, undisclosed or unverified carry no amount. Nothing is estimated.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Capital raised counts equity, venture debt and grants with a stated amount; exits and acquisitions are excluded.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Dates: day and month dates are kept; year-only dates get no month and stay out of the monthly and time-intelligence views.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Greek funds: matched by name in the investors text, using the tracker's fund list. Role (lead, participant, earlier round) is read from the same text.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Limits",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0B3C5D"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "One round per company: the market map stores the last known round, so this is not a funding history and the year view shows when last rounds happened, not total yearly investment.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "One weekly snapshot so far: momentum compares two windows inside that snapshot; open job posts and last GitHub pushes favour recent dates.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Converting historic rounds at one recent FX rate is a simplification. EU grant amounts are the EU contribution to the whole project, not the company's share.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "By default the report shows Include and Borderline companies (report filter on Map status).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
